    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "C. 85 M² MID TERRACED 2-BEDROOM / 2 BATHROOM FAMILY HOME LOCATED IN A HIGHLY CONVENIENT LOCATION CLOSE TO THE ASHDOWN HOTEL, GOREY SHOPPING CENTRE AND A SHORT WALK INTO GOREYS BUSY VIBRANT MAIN STREET.  LOCAL TRAIN STATION IS ALSO LOCATED CLOSE BY.  IDEAL FIRST TIME BUYER PROPERTY OR INVESTMENT PROPERTY.   LOCATED IN A SMALL CUL-DE-SAC WITHIN THE DEVELOPMENT."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY\t   (1.92M x 3.1M)\t\t\r\nWith tiled flooring and carpeted stairs to first floor.\r\n\r\nSITTING/DINING ROOM   (4.57M x 5.31M)\t\t\t\t\r\nLocated to the rear with tiled flooring, open fireplace with timber surround and tile hearth.  Double doors leading \r\nout to the rear garden and open through to the kitchen.  Storage Cupboard (0.92M x 2.37M)\r\n\r\nKITCHEN   (2.45M x 2.53M)\r\nLocated to the front with shaker style fitted kitchen and incorporating  Beko hob and oven.   Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLANDING\t\t\t\t\r\nWith carpeted flooring and location of hot press and attic access. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1   (4.66M x 2.44M)\r\nLocated to the front of the house with carpeted flooring and built in wardrobe area.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM   (2.62M x 1.74M)\t\t\t\r\nWith white suite, wc/whb/bath.  Tiled flooring and half tiled wall around bath.  Mirror and shaver light point\r\nover sink.  Dimplex heater.\r\n\r\nMAIN BEDROOM 2   (3.47M x 2.89M) + (1.70M x 1.31M)\r\nLocated to the rear with carpeted flooring and mirrored wardrobe.\r\nEN-SUITE   (2.02M x 1.55M)\t\t\t\t\r\nWith wc, sink and built in shower unit (pump shower).  Lino floor and mirror and shaver light point over sink. \r\nDimplex heater. \r\n\r\nGARDENS\r\nRear garden is overgrown and requires a little TLC.  Paved patio area.  Timber fenced boundaries.\r\nProperty is not overlooked from the rear boundary.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nESB, Water & Sewerage – general mains supply. \r\nExternal Windows & Doors – uPVC double glazed throughout.\r\nHeating System – Electric Storage Heating.\r\nBER D2 (Number: 119406502)\r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nClonattin Village is a well established and popular development which is located just north of Gorey’s Main Street.  \r\nNo. 64 is located in a small cul-de-sac area of 24 homes and stands mid terrace in a block of four houses.  Clonattin Village is located just minutes walk from the Ashdown Park Hotel and the Gorey Shopping Centre.  Gorey’s primary and secondary schools, transport links and the busy thriving Gorey Main Street are all within easy walking distance.  This location also offers easy access onto the motorway, the commute to south Dublin is under an hours drive away.  The property comes onto the market in good condition with the rear garden needing a little attention. This property would be ideal for a first time buyer home or as an investment property and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
